<title>CHINA: Pudong Dev yearly net jumps sharply.</title>
<headline>Pudong Dev yearly net jumps sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>     Shr (H.K. cents)	 5.5	  vs 1.6</p>
<p>     Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>     Exceptional items	32.62 gain vs 1.40 loss</p>
<p>     Net			  55.36	vs 15.94</p>
<p>     Turnover		   602.39     vs 345.06</p>
<p>     Company name	     Pudong Development Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>     Books close		N/A</p>
<p>     Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Pudong Development is a property investment holding company. Exceptional items represents gain from capital reserve on consolidation realised on sale of investment properties and write back provision for diminution in value of marketable securities.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
